T Props on the table
# Everything in the catalogue, with its real size, mass and friction, sitting on a rig you can knock over.
# node cli.js props lists them. Grab one in the bench and throw it at the tower.
! a tower to knock down: two A-frames tied by an axle through their tops
C B1 W8 -1,-2,0.5 x y
C B2 W8 -1,2,0.5 x y
C B3 W8 1,-2,0.5 x y
C B4 W8 1,2,0.5 x y
C T1 W8 -1,0,2.5 x y
C T2 W8 1,0,2.5 x y
R B1 B2
R B3 B4
R B1 T1
R B2 T1
R B3 T2
R B4 T2
R -1,0,2.5 1,0,2.5 blue
! the props: real mass, real friction, real shapes
X phone -3,-2,0.13
X book 3,-2,0.3
X weight -3,1,0.55
X bottle 3,1,2.867
X can -2,3,1.535
X ball 0,-4,0.58
X ball-tennis 2,3,0.9
X coin 2,-4,0.03
! one thrown at the tower, so something happens the moment you press run
X ball-steel -4,0,1.5 vel=2.2,0,0.4 spin=0,14,0
